{"id":"n71281-7-7","stage":1,"title":"시원하다 · 舒畅","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71281-7-7-1","ko":"내가 지수한테 욕을 실컷 해 줬어!","zh":"我可把智秀骂了个够本呢！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지수한테","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"지수한테","audio":"/audio/8193d62d9944d3738746.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"욕을","meaning":"骂，辱骂","explanation":"욕：骂，辱骂；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"욕","audio":"/audio/b2974a63b590dbc9424d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26624","senseId":"1","lemma":"욕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"실컷","meaning":"狠狠地","explanation":"실컷：狠狠地","readings":[{"term":"실컷","audio":"/audio/5f58ab67054aac9b5043.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14126","senseId":"2","lemma":"실컷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줬어!","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"b2974a63b590dbc9","term":"욕","zh":"骂，辱骂","audio":"/audio/b2974a63b590dbc9424d.mp3","entryId":"26624","definition":"无视或责备别人的下流的话语。","pronunciation":["욕"]},{"id":"5f58ab67054aac9b","term":"실컷","zh":"狠狠地","audi